# Cyberpunk Terminal

Route `/cyberpunk-terminal`. Logic stays in `components/terminal/`. Read Project 02 in @cyber_playground_roadmap.md.

- Dark vector map with parabolic transmission arcs.
- Scrolling binary and hexadecimal glyph rain.
- Breach progress is a simulated display.
- The shell accepts `help`, `hack`, `status`, and `override`, and prints simulated logs only.
